#: src/Integrations/AI/Admin/PrivacyPolicy.php:105
msgid "This sample text covers the WPForms AI features. Include it only if the administrators of this site use them, and adjust it to match how your site is run."
msgstr "Este texto de exemplo trata sobre as características de IA de WPForms. Inclúeo só se os administradores deste sitio as usan e axústao á forma en que se xestiona o teu sitio."

#: src/Integrations/AI/Admin/PrivacyPolicy.php:100
msgid "Site administrators can turn off all AI features under WPForms → Settings → Misc."
msgstr "Os administradores do sitio poden desactivar todas as características de IA en WPForms → Axustes → Varios."

#: src/Integrations/AI/Admin/PrivacyPolicy.php:97
msgid "The AI service is authenticated through WPForms Lite Connect at wpformsliteconnect.com."
msgstr "O servizo de IA identifícase mediante WPForms Lite Connect en wpformsliteconnect.com."

#. translators: %1$d - number of days within which identifiers are removed from
#. stored prompts and AI responses, %2$d - number of days after which a stored
#. record no longer carries the domain used for the request.
#: src/Integrations/AI/Admin/PrivacyPolicy.php:89
msgid "Prompts and AI responses are stored on infrastructure hosted by Cloudflare and PlanetScale, and error diagnostics are sent to Sentry. All processing takes place in the United States. Within %1$d days of a request, email addresses, phone numbers, web addresses, IP addresses and payment or bank account numbers are removed from the stored prompt and response, and after %2$d days the stored record no longer carries the domain used for the request."
msgstr "As instrucións e as respostas da IA almacénanse nunha infraestrutura aloxada por Cloudflare e PlanetScale, e os diagnósticos de erros envíanse a Sentry. Todo o procesamento ten lugar nos Estados Unidos. Dentro dos %1$d días seguintes a unha solicitude, elimínanse das instrucións e respostas almacenadas os enderezos de correo electrónico, os números de teléfono, os enderezos web, os enderezos IP e os números de tarxetas de pago ou de contas bancarias, e despois de %2$d días o rexistro almacenado xa non contén o dominio usado para a solicitude."

#: src/Integrations/AI/Admin/Builder/FormEditor.php:328
msgid "Undoing the last change..."
msgstr "Desfacendo o último cambio…"

#: src/Integrations/AI/Admin/Builder/FormEditor.php:326
